Package: libstartup-notification0
Version: @DEB_STARTUPNOTIFICATION_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/startup-notification/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libx11-6, libxcb1
Description: Library for tracking application startup
 Contains the startup-notification library, used by window managers and
 launchers (xfwm4, xfce4-panel) to give the user visual feedback while an
 application is starting up.
